  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4be51c5168caa0d42bd51f33c68daba8, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chief's Order
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  letterTitle: 
  pages:
  - 'With it, we may finally gain silence over what remains of the Palasdine outbreak
    zones. The infected should not move as freely in cold condition whether by weakness
    or delay in decay, it matters little. What matters is containment. The doctor
    must be captured.

    I will not pretend this is only strategic. My daughter
    is still unaccounted for. Search efforts have yielded nothing but scattered movement
    reports that cannot be confirmed. I have been told to accept loss as probability.
    I cannot. All available mapping units are to continue limited sweep operations
    until snowfall blocks passage entirely. After that point, we hold the line and
    wait for winter to do what men cannot.'
  letterImage: {fileID: 0}
